 "title": "Genoa, 7 March 1527: fifteen galleys together",
 "caption": "Cipher lines 16&ndash;19 of c. 10r of Lope de Soria&rsquo;s letter to Charles de Lannoy, decoded sign by sign and group by group with the key recovered here from the ciphertext alone (key.tsv; values as solve/measure.py chose them). Word division is editorial. With the six imperial galleys from Naples and the nine at Genoa, &ldquo;siendo aqui quinze galeras iuntas sin duda romperian las de Francia aunque estouieesen ein qualquiera puerto&rdquo;.",
 "unit": "signs and code groups",
